<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1,viewport-fit=cover">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#1f4fb8">
<title>Road Gist</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Bricolage+Grotesque:opsz,wght@12..96,600;12..96,800&family=Figtree:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap">
<style>
/* Layout: one narrow phone column. Report buttons up top, live feed below, big talk button pinned to the bottom within thumb reach. */
:root {
  --bg: #f3f1ec; --surface: #ffffff; --ink: #1b1d1a; --muted: #62665e; --line: #dcd8cf;
  --police: #1f4fb8; --police-soft: #e5ecfb; --slow: #c2410c; --slow-soft: #fdeadf;
  --sign: #f5b301; --ok: #18794e; --ok-soft: #e1f3ea; --on-color: #ffffff;
  --display: "Bricolage Grotesque", "Arial Black", system-ui, sans-serif;
  --body: "Figtree", system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
  color-scheme: light;
}
@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) { :root {
  --bg: #141613; --surface: #1e211d; --ink: #eceee8; --muted: #a2a79c; --line: #33372f;
  --police: #7ea2f5; --police-soft: #1d2840; --slow: #fb8a52; --slow-soft: #3a2116;
  --ok: #4fc58c; --ok-soft: #15301f; --on-color: #111; color-scheme: dark } }

* { box-sizing: border-box; }
html, body { margin: 0; }
body { background: var(--bg); color: var(--ink); font-family: var(--body); font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.45; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; }
.wrap { max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto; display: grid; gap: 20px;
  padding-top: max(20px, env(safe-area-inset-top, 0px));
  padding-bottom: calc(150px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom, 0px));
  padding-left: max(16px, env(safe-area-inset-left, 0px)); padding-right: max(16px, env(safe-area-inset-right, 0px)); }

header { display: grid; gap: 6px; }
.brand { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; }
.sign { width: 34px; height: 34px; flex: none; background: var(--sign); transform: rotate(45deg); border-radius: 5px; display: grid; place-items: center; border: 2px solid var(--ink); }
.sign span { transform: rotate(-45deg); font-family: var(--display); font-weight: 800; color: #1b1d1a; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1; }
h1 { font-family: var(--display); font-weight: 800; font-size: 34px; letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin: 0; line-height: 1; }
.tag { color: var(--muted); margin: 0; max-width: 44ch; }

.report-bar { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 10px; }
.big { border: 0; border-radius: 14px; padding: 16px 14px; text-align: left; cursor: pointer; font: inherit; display: grid; gap: 2px; color: var(--on-color); }
.big b { font-family: var(--display); font-size: 19px; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.1; }
.big small { opacity: .9; font-size: 13px; }
.big.police { background: var(--police); } .big.slow { background: var(--slow); }
button:focus-visible, select:focus-visible, input:focus-visible, textarea:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid var(--sign); outline-offset: 2px; }

.panel { background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 16px; padding: 16px; display: grid; gap: 12px; }
.panel h2 { margin: 0; font-family: var(--display); font-size: 20px; font-weight: 800; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; }
.dot { width: 12px; height: 12px; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block; flex: none; }
label { display: grid; gap: 4px; font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px; }
label .opt { font-weight: 400; color: var(--muted); }
input, select, textarea { font: inherit; font-size: 16px; padding: 10px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid var(--line); background: var(--bg); color: var(--ink); width: 100%; }
textarea { resize: vertical; min-height: 64px; }
.row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 10px; }
.actions { display: flex; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
.btn { font: inherit; font-weight: 700; border-radius: 10px; padding: 10px 16px; cursor: pointer; border: 1px solid var(--line); background: var(--surface); color: var(--ink); }
.btn.primary { background: var(--ink); color: var(--bg); border-color: var(--ink); }
.btn:disabled { opacity: .5; cursor: wait; }

.toolbar { display: flex; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; }
.chips { display: flex; gap: 6px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
.chip { font: inherit; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 999px; border: 1px solid var(--line); background: var(--surface); color: var(--ink); cursor: pointer; }
.chip[aria-pressed="true"] { background: var(--ink); color: var(--bg); border-color: var(--ink); }
.toolbar select { width: auto; padding: 6px 10px; font-size: 14px; }

.feed-head { display: flex; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between; gap: 8px; }
.feed-head h2 { font-family: var(--display); font-size: 22px; font-weight: 800; margin: 0; }
.live { font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted); display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; }
.live i { width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--ok); display: inline-block; }
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) { .live i { animation: pulse 2s infinite; } }
@keyframes pulse { 50% { opacity: .3; } }

.feed { display: grid; gap: 10px; }
.card { background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-left: 6px solid var(--c); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px; display: grid; gap: 8px; min-width: 0; }
.card.police { --c: var(--police); --cs: var(--police-soft); }
.card.goslow { --c: var(--slow); --cs: var(--slow-soft); }
.card-top { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; gap: 8px; }
.kind { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .06em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--c); background: var(--cs); padding: 3px 8px; border-radius: 6px; white-space: nowrap; }
.when { font-size: 13px; color: var(--muted); text-align: right; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
.place { font-family: var(--display); font-weight: 800; font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.15; margin: 0; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
.place small { display: block; font-family: var(--body); font-weight: 500; font-size: 14px; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 2px; }
.note { margin: 0; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
.votes { display: flex; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
.vote { font: inherit; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; border-radius: 8px; padding: 6px 10px; border: 1px solid var(--line); background: var(--bg); color: var(--ink); cursor: pointer; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
.vote[aria-pressed="true"].yes { background: var(--cs); border-color: var(--c); color: var(--c); }
.vote[aria-pressed="true"].no { background: var(--ok-soft); border-color: var(--ok); color: var(--ok); }
.vote.ghost { border-color: transparent; background: transparent; color: var(--muted); }

.empty { text-align: center; padding: 28px 16px; border: 2px dashed var(--line); border-radius: 16px; color: var(--muted); display: grid; gap: 6px; }
.empty b { font-family: var(--display); font-size: 20px; color: var(--ink); }
.notice { font-size: 14px; padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 10px; background: var(--slow-soft); border: 1px solid var(--line); }
footer { font-size: 13px; color: var(--muted); display: grid; gap: 4px; }

/* Talk bar */
.talkbar { position: fixed; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0; z-index: 30; background: var(--surface); border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  padding-top: 12px; padding-bottom: calc(14px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom, 0px));
  padding-left: max(16px, env(safe-area-inset-left, 0px)); padding-right: max(16px, env(safe-area-inset-right, 0px)); }
.talk-inner { max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; }
.mic { width: 84px; height: 84px; flex: none; border-radius: 50%; border: 4px solid var(--ink); background: var(--sign); color: #1b1d1a; cursor: pointer; display: grid; place-items: center; touch-action: manipulation; }
.mic svg { width: 36px; height: 36px; }
.mic[data-state="listening"] { background: #d92d20; color: #fff; }
.mic[data-state="speaking"] { background: var(--police); color: #fff; }
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) { .mic[data-state="listening"] { animation: ring 1.2s infinite; } }
@keyframes ring { 0% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(217,45,32,.5); } 100% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 18px rgba(217,45,32,0); } }
.talk-text { min-width: 0; display: grid; gap: 2px; }
.talk-text b { font-family: var(--display); font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.15; }
.talk-text span { font-size: 14px; color: var(--muted); overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
.talk-text em { font-style: normal; color: var(--ink); }
.toast { position: fixed; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%); bottom: calc(130px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom, 0px)); background: var(--ink); color: var(--bg); padding: 10px 16px; border-radius: 10px; font-weight: 600; z-index: 40; max-width: calc(100% - 32px); }
[hidden] { display: none !important; }
.sr { position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0 0 0 0); }
@media (max-width: 380px) { .row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } h1 { font-size: 30px; } .mic { width: 72px; height: 72px; } }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">
  <header>
    <div class="brand"><div class="sign" aria-hidden="true"><span>!</span></div><h1>Road Gist</h1></div>
    <p class="tag">Police roadblock and go-slow alert for our people for Cape Town. Wetin you see for road, tell others.</p>
  </header>

  <div id="notice" class="notice" hidden></div>

  <div class="report-bar">
    <button class="big police" id="btn-police" type="button"><b>Police dey road</b><small>Report roadblock</small></button>
    <button class="big slow" id="btn-goslow" type="button"><b>Go-slow dey</b><small>Report traffic</small></button>
  </div>

  <form class="panel" id="form" hidden>
    <h2><span class="dot" id="form-dot"></span><span id="form-title">Report</span></h2>
    <div class="row">
      <label for="f-area">Which area?<select id="f-area" required></select></label>
      <label for="f-dir">Which side? <span class="opt">(optional)</span>
        <select id="f-dir"><option value="">I no sure</option><option>Going to town</option><option>Coming from town</option><option>Both sides</option></select>
      </label>
    </div>
    <label for="f-road">Which road or landmark?
      <input id="f-road" list="roads" maxlength="80" required placeholder="e.g. Voortrekker Rd by Shoprite">
      <datalist id="roads"></datalist>
    </label>
    <label for="f-note">Extra gist <span class="opt">(optional)</span>
      <textarea id="f-note" maxlength="200" placeholder="e.g. Dem dey check licence and papers"></textarea>
    </label>
    <div class="actions">
      <button class="btn primary" id="f-submit" type="submit">Drop am</button>
      <button class="btn" id="f-cancel" type="button">Cancel</button>
    </div>
  </form>

  <section style="display:grid;gap:12px">
    <div class="feed-head"><h2>Wetin dey road now</h2><span class="live" id="live"><i></i>Live</span></div>
    <div class="toolbar">
      <div class="chips" role="group" aria-label="Filter by type">
        <button class="chip" data-f="all" aria-pressed="true" type="button">All</button>
        <button class="chip" data-f="police" aria-pressed="false" type="button">Police</button>
        <button class="chip" data-f="goslow" aria-pressed="false" type="button">Go-slow</button>
      </div>
      <select id="area-filter" aria-label="Filter by area"></select>
    </div>
    <div class="feed" id="feed"><div class="empty"><b>Dey load…</b><span>We dey check wetin people don report.</span></div></div>
  </section>

  <footer>
    <span>Talk am: tap the yellow button once, then say something like "Police dey Voortrekker Road for Bellville" or "Go-slow for N1 Parow". Say "Wetin dey road?" to hear the latest.</span>
    <span>Police report go off after 2 hours, go-slow after 1 hour, unless person confirm say e still dey.</span>
    <span>Mount your phone. No hold am and no type while you dey drive.</span>
  </footer>
</div>

<div class="talkbar">
  <div class="talk-inner">
    <button class="mic" id="mic" type="button" data-state="idle" aria-label="Talk to Road Gist">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="9" y="2.5" width="6" height="12" rx="3"/><path d="M5 11a7 7 0 0 0 14 0"/><path d="M12 18v3.5"/></svg>
    </button>
    <div class="talk-text" aria-live="polite">
      <b id="talk-title">Tap and talk</b>
      <span id="talk-sub">Say "Police dey Main Road for Wynberg"</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="toast" id="toast" hidden></div>

<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@supabase/supabase-js@2.57.4/dist/umd/supabase.js"></script>
<script>
